{"title":"2025 TMTA High School Algebra I Contest Problems/Problem 36","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest_Problems/Problem_36&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>What value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> satisfies the equation <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/4/b/c4bccc48fdc80d3fd68a34103198273f22cc41d4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{2}{x+2}+\\frac{1}{x-2}=\\frac{5}{x^2-4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -15px\" width=\"193\" height=\"40\" />?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/2/6/8268529cb2a828f534cf7d8e33986c6b047a82f4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\  x=2 \\qquad \\textbf{(B)}\\  x=-2 \\qquad \\textbf{(C)}\\  x=-\\frac{1}{3} \\qquad \\textbf{(D)}\\  x=\\frac{7}{3} \\qquad \\textbf{(E)}\\  \\text{No solution} \\qquad$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"634\" height=\"38\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest_Problems/Problem_36&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/c/f/ecfede576e75ab10865c13aa8995e286ad36adcb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^{2} - 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"51\" height=\"18\" /> factors into <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/9/b/a9b0711ea07ea32f3affce1b673f624c9bc8a83f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(x + 2)(x - 2)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"114\" height=\"20\" /> using <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Difference_of_squares\" title=\"Difference of squares\">difference of squares</a>. Multiplying both sides by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/9/b/a9b0711ea07ea32f3affce1b673f624c9bc8a83f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(x + 2)(x - 2)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"114\" height=\"20\" />, we have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/a/2/1a210c7c53626799fb04168a4be87670ad0d2c95.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2(x - 2) + x + 2 = 5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"164\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/b/c/ebc9b7652bafaa8664c1fa528852a447ca2fa3af.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2x - 4 + x + 2 = 5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"150\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/4/ad46cfb8aba1e6e9acac76d4a637a477f85aae8e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3x - 2 = 5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"86\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/f/e5f676a1e2e4f02f872a93188e27276b6ce83690.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3x = 5 + 2 = 7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"119\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/1/9/31930b68aacfaa4461f406e156e82e54518dfbad.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf {(D) } \\frac{7}{3}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -19px\" width=\"62\" height=\"49\" />\n</p><p>¬anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest\" title=\"2025 TMTA High School Algebra I Contest\">2025 TMTA Algebra I</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest_Problems\" title=\"2025 TMTA High School Algebra I Contest Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest_Answer_Key\" title=\"2025 TMTA High School Algebra I Contest Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest_Problems/Problem_35\" title=\"2025 TMTA High School Algebra I Contest Problems/Problem 35\">Problem 35</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest_Problems/Problem_37\" title=\"2025 TMTA High School Algebra I Contest Problems/Problem 37\">Problem 37</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2025 TMTA High School Algebra I Contest Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2025 TMTA High School Algebra I Contest Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2025 TMTA High School Algebra I Contest Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2025 TMTA High School Algebra I Contest Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2025 TMTA High School Algebra I Contest Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2025 TMTA High School Algebra I Contest Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest